    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "BRANIFF\nSCHEDULES\nEFFECTIVE\nSEPTEMBER 1\n1980\nBraniff International",
      "NEW SERVICE\nHIGHLIGHTS\nEUROPE\n• From Dallas-Fort Worth, the only service to\nLondon's convenient Gatwick Airport, all\n747s, everyday, plus the only 747 thru-plane\nservice to Amsterdam, Brussels and Frankfurt.\n• From Boston, Braniff has the only non-stop\n747 service to all of these European cities —\nAmstersdam, Brussels, Frankfurt and Paris'\nclose-in Orly Airport.\nFAR EAST/\nPACIFIC\n• From Los Angeles, the most non-stops to\nSeoul, all 747SP; the only 747SP service to\nHong Kong and Guam.\n• Business Class Service on every flight.\nSOUTH\nAMERICA\n• From New York's JFK Airport, Braniff offers\nthe only non-stop service to Panama plus\nnon-stops to Buenos Aires and Guayaquil.\n• From Miami, Braniff flies non-stop to Rio de\nJaneiro, Buenos Aires, Bogota, Guayaquil,\nLima, Panama and Quito.\n• From Los Angeles and San Francisco, Braniff\nhas the only thru service to sao Paulo,\ncontinuing on to Rio. Plus non-stops to\nBogota, Lima and Santiago from Los Angeles;\nthru from San Francisco.\n• From New Orleans, Braniff has the only non-\nstop service to Maracaibo and Panama and the\nonly thru service to Caracas.\nWe better be better.\nWere\nBraniff\nMainland U.S.A., Hawaii, Canada, The Pacific, Mexico,\nSouth America, Britain, Europe, Asia,",
      "• Fairbanks\nAnchorage\nSeattle/Tacoma\nPortland\n• Calgary\nHong Kong\n•\nMinneapolis/St. Paul\nAlbany\nBoston\nMilwaukee\n•\ncago\nDetroit\nCleveland\nReno\nSalt Lake City\nDes Moines\nOmaha\nHartford\nNew York\nNewark\nPhiladelphia\nWashington\nDenver\nSan Francisco\nLas\nVegas\nLos Angeles\n•\nColorado\nSprings\nKansas City\nWichita\nAmarillo •\nOklahoma\nCity\nulsa\nMemphis\n• Nashville\nAtlanta\n• Phoenix\nTucson •\nLubbock\nMidland/Odessa\nDallas-Fort Worth\n• Jacksonville\nHonolulu\nAustin\nSan Antonio •\nHouston\nNew\nOrleans\nOrlando\nTampa\nWest Palm Beach\n• Corpus Christi\nSt. Petersburg\nFt. Lauderdale\nU.S. Mainland\nClearwater\nMiami\nHawaii\nBrownsville\nCanada\nAlaska\nBRANIFF INTERNATIONAL\nSan Francisco •\nBoston\nNew York\nWashington, D.C\nLondon\n› Amsterdam\nBrussels\n• Frankfurt\nParis\nSeoul •\nLos Angeles\nDallas-Fort Worth\nHouston\nSan Antonio\nAcapulco •\nHonolulu\nGuam\nNew\nMiami\nOrleans\nMexico City\nMaracaibo\nPanama, City i\n• Caracas\nfallen Bogota\nQuito\nGuayaquil\nGateways For\nAfrica\nAsia\nEurope\nMiddle East\nTransatlantic\nTranspacific\nMexico\nSouth America\nManaus\nLima\nLa Paz\nSão\n• Paulo •\nAsunción\n• Rio de Janeiro\nSantiago\nBuenos Aires"
